OL,3,GNEWSATaoiseach to set up initiative on
OL,4,Aconstitutional future of the island
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Taoiseach (Irish prime minister)
OL,7,FMicheal Martin is to set up a new
OL,8,F"initiative" on the constitutional
OL,9,Ffuture of the island of Ireland.
OL,11,FIt comes as the party's coalition
OL,12,Fpartner, Fine Gael, is to unveil its
OL,13,Fplans for a "blueprint" on Irish unity
OL,14,Fat its ard fheis (annual party
OL,15,Fconference) this weekend in Cork.
OL,17,FHe outlined his plans in a private
OL,18,Fmeeting with his parliamentary party,
OL,19,FFianna Fail, in Dublin on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
