OL,3,GNEWSATaoiseach to set up initiative on
OL,4,Aconstitutional future of the island
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Taoiseach's Futures Study
OL,7,FInitiative will "seek to provide an
OL,8,Fobjective, independent knowledge base
OL,9,Fwhich can be used to inform specific
OL,10,Fproposals", according to a policy
OL,11,Fdocument produced by Martin in the
OL,12,Fmeeting.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
